256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Theoretically optimal transitive closure is resource-prohibitive on modern GPUs. Partition Refinement remains the practical family for GPU-accelerated DFA minimization. sortPR is the recommended general-purpose algorithm for most real-world systems. transPR provides necessary specialization for significant speedups on long-chain DFAs.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
